@node Top
@top mdired User Guide

Version: 0.2.1-rc.1

Copyright © 2026 @w{Charles Y. Choi}

@strong{mdired} is an Elisp package that provides commands for running @uref{https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single_instruction@comma{}_multiple_data, SIMD}-style operations on marked Dired (@ref{Dired,,,emacs,}) items.

Please be advised: @strong{mdired} can make irreversible changes to the file system if no prior checkpoint (typically via a source code management or backup tool) is available. Exercise caution.


If you enjoy using @strong{mdired}@comma{} please consider buying me a coffee to help support its development and maintenance.

@uref{https://www.buymeacoffee.com/kickingvegas}

@end ifnottex

